---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
---

<MainLayout
  title="About 1st Capital Locksmith | Professional Locksmith in Dover, DE"
  description="1st Capital Locksmith is Dover Delaware's trusted mobile locksmith company. We provide fast, professional automotive, residential, commercial, and emergency locksmith services throughout Kent County and surrounding areas."
>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section
    class="relative min-h-[500px] flex items-center text-white py-20"
    style="background-image: url('/images/hero.png'); background-size: cover; background-position: center;"
  >
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/70"></div>
    <div class="relative max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 z-10">
      <p class="text-[#9A9D62] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-sm mb-4">
        About 1st Capital Locksmith
      </p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6 max-w-3xl leading-tight">
        Dover Delaware's Trusted Mobile Locksmith Company
      </h1>
      <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
        1st Capital Locksmith provides fast, reliable, and professional mobile locksmith services throughout Dover, Kent County, and surrounding Delaware communities. We specialize in automotive, residential, commercial, and emergency locksmith solutions.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
        <a
          href="tel:3027350050"
          class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-[#A61E22] px-8 py-3 text-white font-semibold hover:bg-[#8C181B] transition"
        >
          Call (302) 735-0050
        </a>
        <a
          href="/contact"
          class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-white px-8 py-3 text-white font-semibold hover:bg-white hover:text-[#1A1F22] transition"
        >
          Get a Free Quote
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Who We Are -->
  <section class="bg-white py-20">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
        <div>
          <p class="text-[#9A9D62] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-sm mb-3">Who We Are</p>
          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-6">
            Professional Locksmith Services in Dover, Delaware
          </h2>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
            1st Capital Locksmith is a locally owned and operated mobile locksmith company proudly serving Dover, Delaware and the surrounding Kent County region. Our team of trained and experienced locksmiths is dedicated to providing fast, dependable, and affordable locksmith services to homeowners, vehicle owners, and businesses throughout the area.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
            Whether you need an emergency car lockout service, a residential rekey after moving into a new home, a commercial lock upgrade for your business, or a replacement key programmed on-site, 1st Capital Locksmith has the skills and equipment to handle the job efficiently and professionally.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
            We understand that lock and key issues can be stressful and time-sensitive. That's why we prioritize fast response times, clear communication, and transparent pricing on every service call. When you call 1st Capital Locksmith, you can expect a knowledgeable professional to arrive at your location fully prepared to resolve your issue.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-[#0E1B2F] rounded-3xl p-8 text-white">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6">Why Choose 1st Capital Locksmith?</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-4">
            <li class="flex gap-3">
              <span class="text-[#9A9D62] font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0">✓</span>
              <span>Fully mobile — we come directly to your location</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex gap-3">
              <span class="text-[#9A9D62] font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0">✓</span>
              <span>Fast dispatch and quick on-site arrival times</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex gap-3">
              <span class="text-[#9A9D62] font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0">✓</span>
              <span>Trained and experienced locksmith technicians</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex gap-3">
              <span class="text-[#9A9D62] font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0">✓</span>
              <span>Upfront pricing with no hidden fees or surprise charges</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex gap-3">
              <span class="text-[#9A9D62] font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0">✓</span>
              <span>Non-destructive entry methods to protect your property</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex gap-3">
              <span class="text-[#9A9D62] font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0">✓</span>
              <span>Automotive, residential, commercial, and emergency services</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex gap-3">
              <span class="text-[#9A9D62] font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0">✓</span>
              <span>Serving Dover, Kent County, and surrounding Delaware areas</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Our Mission -->
  <section class="bg-[#F8F8F5] py-20">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 text-center">
      <p class="text-[#9A9D62] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-sm mb-3">Our Mission</p>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-6">
        Reliable Locksmith Service When You Need It Most
      </h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700 text-lg max-w-4xl mx-auto leading-relaxed mb-6">
        Our mission at 1st Capital Locksmith is simple — provide every customer in Dover and Kent County with fast, professional, and honest locksmith service at a fair price. We believe that being locked out of your home, car, or business is already stressful enough. Our job is to make the solution as easy and hassle-free as possible.
      </p>
      <p class="text-gray-700 text-lg max-w-4xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        From routine residential rekeying to emergency lockouts and commercial security upgrades, we approach every job with the same level of professionalism, attention to detail, and commitment to customer satisfaction. We are proud to serve the Dover community and dedicated to being the most trusted locksmith company in Delaware.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Our Services -->
