          <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm mb-4 leading-relaxed">Office lockouts, commercial rekeying, panic bar installation, master key systems, and high-security lock solutions for businesses of all sizes.</p>
          <a href="/services/commercial-locksmith" class="text-[#A61E22] hover:text-[#8C181B] font-semibold text-sm transition">Learn more →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-200">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-[#A61E22] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6 text-white" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 17h5l-1.405-1.405A2.032 2.032 0 0118 14.158V11a6 6 0 10-12 0v3.159c0 .538-.214 1.055-.595 1.436L4 17h5m6 0v1a3 3 0 11-6 0v-1m6 0H9" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-[#1A1F22] mb-3">Emergency Locksmith</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm mb-4 leading-relaxed">Urgent home, vehicle, and business lockouts, broken key extraction, and emergency lock repairs when you need fast professional assistance.</p>
          <a href="/services/emergency-locksmith" class="text-[#A61E22] hover:text-[#8C181B] font-semibold text-sm transition">Learn more →</a>
