          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
            We provide clear upfront pricing before any work begins. No hidden fees, no bait-and-switch pricing, and no surprise charges when the job is done. What we quote is what you pay.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-[#F8F8F5] rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200">
          <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-[#A61E22] mb-4">02</div>
